==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|woensdach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*wuodenesdag}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*Wōdanas dag||day of Woden}}, calque of {{der|nl|la|dies Mercurii}}.

[[Woden]] or [[Wodan]] was the supreme [[Germanic]] god.

